      "note": "The record format version 1 could not write. Two of the three streams the policy declared produced nothing, so there is one row — and a reader of the older record would have seen a robot with one camera rather than a robot with two dead ones. One contributor also means there is no spread to report, and `worst_skew_us` is null rather than the zero that would read as perfect synchronisation.",
